<div class="phead"><div class="w"><ol class="crumbs"><li><a href="{{ PathBase }}/">Home</a></li><li>People</li></ol><p class="kick">People</p><h1>The name on your return</h1><p class="lede">Two partners, a senior tax manager, a nonprofit principal, an advisory manager and the leads for bookkeeping and payroll. Portraits are generated monograms; everyone here is fictional.</p></div></div><section class="sec tight"><div class="w"><div class="ppl big">{% for m in Target.Items %}{%- assign y=m.PublishedContent -%}<a class="person" href="{{ PathBase }}/{{ m.RoutePath }}"><img src="{{ y.portrait.Value | attachment_redirect_url }}" alt="Generated monogram for {{ m.PrimaryField }}" loading="lazy"><b>{{ m.PrimaryField }}</b><small>{{ y.role }}</small>{%- capture _c2 -%}{{ y.credentials }}{%- endcapture -%}{% if _c2 != "" and y.credentials %}<span class="cr">{{ y.credentials }}</span>{% endif %}<p>{{ y.focus }} · ext. {{ y.ext }}</p></a>{% endfor %}</div></div></section>
